# How scripts/deploy-engine builds namchain on pro (x86-64, i5-9500T: Coffee Lake, so the Skylake
# target: AVX2, FMA, BMI2, no AVX-512). Named, not -march=native, so the flags that made a binary
# are in git (working rule 6). Measured 2026-10-31: 14 A2-Full per core against 9 for the baseline
# x86-64 build (bench-results/2026-10-31-cost-pro/).
# Plain KEY=value, sourced by bash.
NAMCHAIN_CXXFLAGS="-march=skylake -mtune=skylake"
